# Generated — safe to delete (see CLAUDE.md project layout).
# Also where every game-derived binary lives: KBU/KBR.EXE, the run-dir .CC
# copies, saves. None of it is ours to distribute.
build/

# Scratch: DOSBox-X captures (screenshots, MEMDUMP.BIN), the Ghidra project
# database (game-derived and fully regenerable — see CLAUDE.md), throwaway files
tmp/

# The user's own game files. The directory itself stays in git (game/README.md)
# so there is somewhere to drop them.
/game/*
!/game/README.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
